<section id="faq" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-faq;"><div class="faq u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="faq__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">Pirms sÄc, iespÄ“jams, vÄ“lies uzzinÄt vairÄk.</h2></div><div class="faq__body"><div class="faq-categories"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style="display:none;"><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title"></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Vai taisnÄ«ba, ka implants var ''neiedzÄ«voties''?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>MÅ«sdienÄs to var saukt par mÄ«tu — implanti iedzÄ«vojas pilnÄ«bÄ visiem cilvÄ“kiem, jo mums ir pieejams plaÅ¡s klÄsts daÅ¾Ädu implantu sistÄ“mu, ko izmantojam katrÄ konkrÄ“tajÄ situÄcijÄ. DaÅ¾os gadÄ«jumos implantu ievietoÅ¡anas operÄciju var atteikt: daÅ¾Ädu hronisku slimÄ«bu gadÄ«jumos, piemÄ“ram, cukura diabÄ“ta slimniekiem, imÅ«nsupresÄ“tiem pacientiem. Riska grupÄ ietilpst arÄ« smÄ“Ä·Ä“tÄji  (tabakas izstrÄdÄjumu) un narkomÄni.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">KÄpÄ“c zaudÄ“tu zobu vajag aizstÄt ar implantu?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Kad tiek zaudÄ“ts zobs, pretÄ“jÄ pusÄ“ esoÅ¡ie sakodiena zobi un blakuszobi steidz aizÅ†emt trÅ«kstoÅ¡Ä zoba vietu, tÄ rezultÄtÄ daÅ¾u gadu laikÄ var zaudÄ“t fizioloÄ£iskÄ sakodiena proporcijas un var rasties Å¾okÄ¼a locÄ«tavas problÄ“mas (trokÅ¡Å†i, sÄpes u. c.). Tas var palielinÄt blakuszobu jutÄ«bu pret aukstu, karstu, skÄbu, sÄÄ¼u vai saldu, kÄ rezultÄtÄ var bÅ«t nepiecieÅ¡ama ÄrstÄ“Å¡ana vai pat citu zobu izrauÅ¡ana. TÄpÄ“c iesakÄm aizvietot trÅ«kstoÅ¡o zobu viena gada laikÄ pÄ“c tÄ zaudÄ“Å¡anas.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Ar kÄdiem implantiem strÄdÄjat?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>MÄ“s strÄdÄjam ar Å veices Straumann implantiem un Straumann Group implantiem Neodent GM.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.3000000000000